<attribute name="authors" nodeId="38f2ba31"></attribute>
<attribute name="changeDate" nodeId="52548067">Wed Apr 19 15:10:48 EDT 2017</attribute>
<attribute name="changeDescription" nodeId="e3215961">APR 2017 - updated role from Organizational Change Manager to Training Designer</attribute>
<attribute name="version" nodeId="ee7c40d0"></attribute>
<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="b18df897">&lt;p&gt;
    Develop a training curriculum which should include the following:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        A catalog of all the training modules to be delivered, and information on the delivery method and high level
        objectives
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        A defined learning journey for each role/group, listing which courses/modules they need to attend, how long each
        course is, and whether the training is required pre- or post-go live (depending on agreed timing of training
        delivery)
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Delivery method and high level objectives for training mapped to each business area
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Agree on&amp;nbsp;the training schedule with key stakeholders. Where unions are involved, agree the number of hours that
    will be committed to training and development. There must be clear agreement on when training can and cannot be
    scheduled, from which expense of time training hours come from, etc.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Document a detailed description of each training course, including course objectives, length, skills and competencies
    fulfilled, target audience and high level content/running order of the course.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop the training curriculum and learning journeys in order to capture the approach developing the training
        modules. Include roles required to attend, content development responsibilities, and timings.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Share with key stakeholders for sign-off
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Update to reflect feedback (if required).
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Feed the outcome into training scheduling in order to work out how to best phase training in order to minimize
        business impact and optimize logistics.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Feed learning journeys into communications and engagement activities.&lt;br /&gt;
        &lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="97a3c694"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="87a40532"></attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="200cb552"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="4b04f76a">To provide content&amp;nbsp;structure&amp;nbsp;for learners with enough detail&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;stakeholders&amp;nbsp;can enact their
business changes.&amp;nbsp; This task aids identification and communication of learning requirements for individual and
business planning purposes; to meet the learning objectives of the training program for the anticipated duration of
training days for each role.</attribute>
